    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i just started a new med for depression (an MAOI) and i'm trying to stay on top of my nutrition. i'm trying to do more of a high protein diet to help with energy. is it cool if i keep things like aged cheddar, salami, and soy sauce in my grocery list? i don't want to mess up my progress if they're actually healthy foods.",
