      "content": "While these items offer some protein, they are quite high in sodium and nitrates, which can be a concern, especially with certain medications. For better support, focus on lean protein sources like chicken breast, fish, and lentils. You can get plenty of flavor and nutrients from fresh herbs and spices instead of relying heavily on cured meats and soy sauce.",
